      <p>
        Note: When North America transitions to daylight saving time (<a href="/edt/">EDT UTC-4</a>, <a href="/cdt/">CDT UTC-5</a>, <a href="/pdt/">PDT UTC-7</a>), subtract 1 hour from the winter difference. For instant conversion calculations, use our live <a href="/gmt-to-est/">GMT to EST Converter tool</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Visual SVG Diagram 2 -->
    <section class="diagram-section">
      <div class="diagram-card">
        <h3>Figure 2: United Kingdom Annual Seasonal Transition (GMT ⇄ BST)</h3>
        <div class="svg-wrapper">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 800 220" width="100%" height="auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="UK GMT to BST Transition Diagram">
            <rect width="800" height="220" fill="var(--panel)" rx="12" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1"/>
            
